@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title To get the list of items on direct sale of a given genre

actor Buyer

participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : I want to get the list of items on direct sale of a given genre
activate System
System --> Buyer : Which genre? Choose!
deactivate System

Buyer -> System : selectedGenre
activate System
System --> Buyer : Shows the list of items on direct sale of the selected genre
deactivate System

@enduml